script = ExtResource("1")
name = "family_storm_a3"
description = "The Storm family built on purpose at the act III boss: expected_a3's level, armor and shrine, a Rare Lance (brutal, swift) with the family's runes (spark_rune, gale_rune), and 10 perks leaning on the family (3+ pieces awake): frenzy, thunderclap, shock_roll, swiftness, precision, strength, vitality, guardian_ring, war_banner. Compared with the other family builds and expected_a3 (pillar 3: builds, not piles; pillar 4: comparable families)."
